        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome 121 added support for the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Headers/Speculation-Rules#specifications\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Speculation-Rules</code></a> HTTP header, which also includes the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Request/destination\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">Request.destination</code></a> value of <code class=\"notranslate\">speculationrules</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3217922770\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40289\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40289/hovercard?comment_id=3071572654&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40289#issuecomment-3071572654\">mdn/content#40289 (comment)</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Also see <a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/nav-speculation/speculation-rules.html#fetch\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://wicg.github.io/nav-speculation/speculation-rules.html#fetch</a> for the spec.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR adds a separate data point for the <code class=\"notranslate\">Request.destination</code> value.</p>\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n\n",
