        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72603?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Declare that FileList API is not supported in Node.js.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"$ node\n\nWelcome to Node.js v22.17.0.\nType &quot;.help&quot; for more information.\n&gt; console.log(FileList);\nUncaught ReferenceError: FileList is not defined\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">$ node\n\nWelcome to Node.js v22.17.0.\nType <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>.help<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"pl-k\">for</span> more information.\n<span class=\"pl-k\">&gt;</span> console.log(FileList)<span class=\"pl-k\">;</span>\nUncaught ReferenceError: FileList is not defined</pre></div>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27294",
