        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Adresses <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2431920257\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/23958\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/23958/hovercard?comment_id=3062666104&amp;comment_type=issue_comment\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/23958#issuecomment-3062666104\">#23958 (comment)</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">We usually use anchors in the form of <code class=\"notranslate\">#dom-interface-member</code> and not <code class=\"notranslate\">#ref-for-interface-member(number)</code>. This PR fixes instances where this is currently not used.</p>",
